  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAD-s8/f90f04f6> ;
  triage:promoteToNotes "MERGE-BLOCKING EXCEPTION: This critical resource-lifecycle correctness bug is newly introduced in s8 and must close on s8 itself, NOT deferred forward per standard promotion policy. The bug is a genuine functional defect (not documentation/hygiene), and propagation down to s9-s11 constitutes a correctness regression. Fix must land on s8 before merge to integrate." .

